So what's another example of this?
那么还有什么例子呢？

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:04.320
What else could we do with this idea?
用这个思路我们还能做什么呢？

00:08:04.320 --> 00:08:06.390
Well, let's get rid of the cat for now.
好吧，我们先把猫去掉。

00:08:06.390 --> 00:08:09.270
And let's bring back our underwater backdrop.
让我们把水下背景再调出来。

00:08:09.270 --> 00:08:11.010
Here's Underwater 1.
这是“水下 1”背景。

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:17.050
And let's add the fish back into our program.
让我们把鱼再添加到程序里。

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:18.750
Here's that fish.
这就是那条鱼。

00:08:18.750 --> 00:08:20.310
And let's try something else.
咱们再试试别的。

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:24.390
When the green flag is clicked, I also want something to happen forever.
当绿色旗帜被点击时，我还希望有件事能一直发生。

00:08:24.390 --> 00:08:25.840
What do I want to have happen?
我希望发生什么事呢？

00:08:25.840 --> 00:08:30.820
Well, let's go to Motion, and let's have it point in a particular direction.
嗯，咱们到“运动”板块，让它指向一个特定的方向。

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:33.520
Now if it were always pointing in the same direction,
现在，如果它总是指向同一个方向，

00:08:33.520 --> 00:08:35.700
then it wouldn't really matter if it was inside of a loop or not.
那么它是否在循环里面其实就无关紧要了。

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:38.100
It's just always going to face the right, face the right, face the right,
它就会一直朝右，朝右，朝右，

00:08:38.100 --> 00:08:40.049
face the right, again and again.
一次又一次地朝右。

00:08:40.049 --> 00:08:43.140
But I could have it point in a particular direction,
但我可以让它指向一个特定的方向，

00:08:43.140 --> 00:08:48.080
and I'll go ahead and choose a block like this instead.
我这就去选一个像这样的积木。

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:50.630
Instead of pointing in a direction with a number,
不用数字来指定方向，

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:53.330
let's have the fish point towards something.
咱们让鱼指向某个东西。

00:08:53.330 --> 00:08:55.190
Let's have it point towards the mouse.
让它指向鼠标。

00:08:55.190 --> 00:08:58.530
It's pointing towards the mouse pointer.
它正指向鼠标指针。

00:08:58.530 --> 00:09:02.140
So now watch what happens when I press the flag.
所以现在看看我点击旗帜后会发生什么。

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:05.480
You'll notice that immediately when I press the flag the fish turned.
你会注意到，我一点击旗帜，鱼就转了方向。

00:09:05.480 --> 00:09:10.600
It's now facing my cursor, which is up in the upper left corner of the stage.
它现在正对着我的光标，光标在舞台的左上角。

00:09:10.600 --> 00:09:14.870
But watch what happens as I move the cursor.
但看看我移动光标时会发生什么。

00:09:14.870 --> 00:09:18.800
Every time I move the cursor you'll notice the fish is moving, as well.
每次我移动光标，你会注意到鱼也在动。

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:23.570
Because it's constantly, over and over forever, following this instruction
因为它一直在不断地、永远地重复这条指令，

00:09:23.570 --> 00:09:26.510
to point towards the mouse pointer.
即指向鼠标指针。

00:09:26.510 --> 00:09:31.030
So wherever the cursor goes, the fish is going to be looking in that direction
所以无论光标移到哪里，鱼都会朝那个方向看，

00:09:31.030 --> 00:09:33.490
because it's pointing towards the mouse pointer.
因为它正指向鼠标指针。

00:09:33.490 --> 00:09:37.010
Now it's looking at the cursor, though it's not really moving yet.
现在它正看着光标，不过还没真正移动。

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:39.310
So let's add one more thing to this program.
咱们给这个程序再加点东西。

00:09:39.310 --> 00:09:41.800
In addition to pointing towards the mouse pointer,
除了指向鼠标指针之外，

00:09:41.800 --> 00:09:47.042
let's then have the fish move five steps.
咱们再让鱼移动五步。

00:09:47.042 --> 00:09:48.750
So now what's going to happen is wherever
所以现在会出现的情况是，无论

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:51.870
the cursor is, the fish is going to look at the cursor
光标在哪里，鱼都会看着光标，

00:09:51.870 --> 00:09:54.430
and then move a little bit closer to that cursor.
然后朝光标靠近一点。

00:09:54.430 --> 00:09:57.360
So using the cursor will effectively be able to control
所以通过使用光标，我们就能有效地控制

00:09:57.360 --> 00:10:00.010
the movement of the fish.
鱼的移动。

00:10:00.010 --> 00:10:03.660
I'll press the green flag again, and you'll notice the fish start
我再点击一次绿色旗帜，你会注意到鱼开始

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:06.450
to move after the cursor.
跟着光标移动。

00:10:06.450 --> 00:10:09.840
Wherever I move the cursor, the fish is pointing in that direction
无论我把光标移到哪里，鱼都会朝那个方向，

00:10:09.840 --> 00:10:12.797
and then swimming in my direction.
然后朝我这边游过来。

00:10:16.132 --> 00:10:18.090
And we can use "forever" for other things, too.
我们也可以把“永远”用于其他事情。

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:21.890
Any time I want something to continue to happen during my program,
任何时候，我想让某件事在我的程序运行期间持续发生，

00:10:21.890 --> 00:10:24.710
a forever loop is often the way that I want to achieve that.
“永远”循环通常就是我实现这一目的的方法。

00:10:24.710 --> 00:10:27.350
Right now, my backdrop, I can click on the backdrop,
现在，我的背景，我可以点击背景，

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:30.770
is just showing me this underwater scene.
它只是给我展示了这个水下场景。

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:33.110
But I can add some blocks to the backdrop,
但我也可以给背景添加一些积木，

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:35.270
as well, telling the backdrop what to do.
告诉背景该做什么。

00:10:35.270 --> 00:10:38.930
And maybe I'll have the backdrop say, when the green flag is clicked,
也许我会让背景在点击绿旗时说，

00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:42.735
let's forever play a sound.
让它永远播放一个声音。

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:48.960
The default sound is "pop", but I can change those sounds.
默认声音是“啵”声，但我可以更改这些声音。

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:52.870
Let's find a sound that's appropriate for being underwater.
让我们找一个适合水下场景的声音。

00:10:52.870 --> 00:10:57.310
And if I scroll down through this long list of sounds, I can try them out,
如果我在这个长长的声音列表中往下滚动，我可以试听一下，

00:10:57.310 --> 00:11:01.736
but I think there's one called--
但我觉得有一个叫——

00:11:01.736 --> 00:11:04.030
Let's search for water maybe?
也许我们搜索一下“水”？

00:11:04.030 --> 00:11:04.757
"Ocean Wave".
“海浪声”。

00:11:04.757 --> 00:11:06.340
Here's "Ocean Wave", related to water.
这里有“海浪声”，和水有关。

00:11:09.840 --> 00:11:11.670
I can sample hear what that sounds like.
我可以在这里试听一下它的声音。

00:11:11.670 --> 00:11:13.570
I like that one.
我喜欢这个声音。

00:11:13.570 --> 00:11:18.250
And so let's have the backdrop play this "Ocean Wave" sound forever.
所以让背景永远播放这个“海浪声”。

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:21.740
It's going to play the sound until it's done, and then play it again.
它会播放这个声音直到结束，然后再重新播放。

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:25.690
And so now when I run the program, notice what you see and hear.
现在当我运行程序时，注意你看到和听到的内容。

00:11:33.480 --> 00:11:36.570
I have the fish following the cursor, and I just stopped the program.
我让鱼跟着光标移动，然后我停止了程序。

00:11:36.570 --> 00:11:39.990
But because I had multiple forever loops, I had a loop on the backdrop,
但因为我有多个无限循环，我在背景上也有一个循环，

00:11:39.990 --> 00:11:44.108
as well, we were just playing this "Ocean Wave" sound over and over again.
所以我们一直在反复播放这个“海浪声”。

00:11:44.108 --> 00:11:46.650
And you could use this if you wanted a sound to play forever.
如果你想让一个声音永远播放，你可以用这个方法。

00:11:46.650 --> 00:11:48.567
You could add music to your programs, as well.
你也可以给你的程序添加音乐。

00:11:48.567 --> 00:11:52.080
If you wanted music to be playing in the background of your Scratch program,
如果你想让音乐在你的Scratch程序背景中播放，

00:11:52.080 --> 00:11:55.060
you might have that music sound play until it's done,
你可以让这个音乐声音播放直到结束，

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:58.350
and then the song starts right back up again as soon as the song is over.
然后歌曲一结束就马上重新开始播放。

00:11:58.350 --> 00:12:02.070
So you can continue to have music in the background of your Scratch program
所以你可以让音乐在你的Scratch程序背景中永远反复播放。

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:04.170
going over and over forever.
所以这些无限循环对于帮助

00:12:04.170 --> 00:12:06.660
So these forever loops can be quite useful for helping
营造这种连续性的感觉非常有用，这种持续的

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:10.590
to create this sense of continuity, this continued
声音或动作的存在，在我们的应用程序中发生。

00:12:10.590 --> 00:12:16.770
presence of sounds or movement that are happening inside of our applications.
所以现在让我们试着创建另一个程序。

00:12:16.770 --> 00:12:20.630
And so let's try now to create another program.
我会去掉鱼，我们也去掉水下背景。

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:24.860
I'll get rid of the fish, and we'll get rid of the underwater backdrop.
让我们回到这个纯色背景。

00:12:24.860 --> 00:12:28.160
Let's go back to this plain backdrop.
我也会去掉这段代码。

00:12:28.160 --> 00:12:30.760
And I'll get rid of this code, too.
让我们把猫加回来。

00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:32.140
Let's bring back the cat.
现在我只是为了好玩，想让猫做的是，

00:12:34.870 --> 00:12:38.620
And what I want the cat to do now, just for fun,
不让我离猫太近。

00:12:38.620 --> 00:12:41.290
is to not let me get too close to the cat.
如果我的光标离猫太近，我希望猫

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:44.380
If my cursor gets too close to the cat, I would like for the cat
喵喵叫之类的，或者以其他方式表明它不

00:12:44.380 --> 00:12:47.380
to meow or something, or otherwise indicate that it doesn't
希望我离得太近，举个例子。

00:12:47.380 --> 00:12:50.330
want me to get too close, for example.
比如，不想让我靠得太近。

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:52.130
And so how might this work?
那么这要如何实现呢？

00:12:52.130 --> 00:12:53.260
Well, let's try this.
嗯，让我们试试这个办法。

00:12:53.260 --> 00:12:55.300
When the green flag is clicked, my instinct
当点击绿色旗帜时，我的直觉是

00:12:55.300 --> 00:12:57.220
might be to say, well, if I want to check
可能会说，如果我想检查

00:12:57.220 --> 00:13:01.420
to make sure that I'm not too close to the cat, that sounds like a condition.
确保我离猫不太近，这听起来像是个条件。

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:02.710
It sounds like an if-then.
听起来像是个“如果……那么……”语句。

00:13:02.710 --> 00:13:05.710
If I'm getting too close to the cat, then have the cat meow
如果我离猫太近了，那么就让猫发出喵叫声

00:13:05.710 --> 00:13:07.760
because it's unhappy, for example.
例如，因为它不高兴了。

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:11.040
And so I might add an if-then.
所以我可能会添加一个“如果……那么……”语句。

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:13.080
And here I can use an operator.
在这里我可以使用一个运算符。

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:15.180
I can use the less than operator, because I
我可以使用小于运算符，因为

00:13:15.180 --> 00:13:19.230
want to check if the distance between the cat and the mouse pointer
我想检查猫和鼠标指针之间的距离

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:22.230
is less than some value, we'll say 100.
是否小于某个值，我们就设为100吧。

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:23.550
And how do I find the distance?
那我要如何计算距离呢？

00:13:23.550 --> 00:13:25.410
That's under the Sensing category.
这在“感知”类别里。

00:13:25.410 --> 00:13:29.220
It turns out there's a block here called "distance to mouse pointer",
原来这里有个名为“到鼠标指针的距离”的积木，

00:13:29.220 --> 00:13:29.970
so I can check.
所以我可以进行检查。

00:13:29.970 --> 00:13:35.000
Is the distance between the cat and the mouse less than 100?
猫和鼠标之间的距离是否小于100呢？

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:42.630
And if so, let's go ahead and play the meow sound until it's done.
如果是，那就播放喵叫声音，直到播放完毕。

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:45.950
So the idea of this code now, what I would like for this code to do,
所以这段代码现在的思路，我希望这段代码实现的功能是，

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:51.260
is to say if I'm less than 100 spaces away from the cat,
就是说如果我离猫不到100个单位的距离，

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:53.480
then go ahead and play the meow sound.
那就播放喵叫声音。

00:13:53.480 --> 00:13:55.760
And that's what I want the cat to do, but watch what
这就是我想让猫做的事，但看看如果我

00:13:55.760 --> 00:13:58.880
happens if I try and run this program.
尝试运行这个程序会发生什么。

00:13:58.880 --> 00:14:00.200
I'll run the program.
我来运行这个程序。

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:04.890
And my cursor starts out pretty far away from the cat, but as I bring the cursor
我的光标一开始离猫挺远的，但当我把光标

00:14:04.890 --> 00:14:08.800
closer nothing seems to be happening.
移近时，好像什么都没发生。

00:14:08.800 --> 00:14:11.980
I'm pretty close to the cat right now, I'm even touching the cat now,
我现在离猫已经很近了，现在甚至都碰到猫了，

00:14:11.980 --> 00:14:15.640
and yet still, I'm not hearing the cat meow.
但我还是没听到猫叫。

00:14:15.640 --> 00:14:16.360
Why is that?
这是为什么呢？

00:14:16.360 --> 00:14:18.430
What's going on?
怎么回事呢？

00:14:18.430 --> 00:14:20.530
Well, it has to do with the fact that by default,
嗯，这和默认情况下的一个事实有关，

00:14:20.530 --> 00:14:22.900
when you're running code inside of a program,
当你在程序里运行代码时，

00:14:22.900 --> 00:14:25.810
that code is only going to run once.
那段代码只会运行一次。

00:14:25.810 --> 00:14:27.730
What happened when I pressed the green flag?
我点击绿色旗帜时发生了什么呢？

00:14:27.730 --> 00:14:31.870
When I took my cursor, and I dragged my cursor over the green flag right there,
当我移动光标，把光标拖到那里的绿色旗帜上，

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:34.810
and then I clicked on it, what was happening inside of the program?
然后点击它，程序内部发生了什么呢？

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:37.240
Well, immediately, Scratch checks.
嗯，Scratch 会立刻进行检查。

00:14:37.240 --> 00:14:38.560
It checks this question.
它会检查这个问题。

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:41.680
Is the distance to the mouse pointer less than 100?
到鼠标指针的距离是否小于100呢？

00:14:41.680 --> 00:14:42.430
Well, no it's not.
不，不是这样的。

00:14:42.430 --> 00:14:46.810
This is more than 100 spaces in the world of Scatch's coordinate system,
在Scratch坐标系里，这超过了100个单位的距离，

00:14:46.810 --> 00:14:48.740
so we didn't play the meow sound.
所以我们没听到猫叫的声音。

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:51.880
And at that point, this stack of blocks was over.
到那时，这组积木就执行完了。

00:14:51.880 --> 00:14:55.150
Nothing else happened because we ran through all of these blocks
没有其他事情发生，因为我们从上到下把这些积木都执行了一遍，

00:14:55.150 --> 00:14:59.320
from top to bottom, and that was the end of the stack of blocks.
这组积木就执行完了。

00:14:59.320 --> 00:15:02.950
What I really wanted to have happen is for this check for this question
我真正希望发生的是，对这个问题的检查

00:15:02.950 --> 00:15:05.590
to be asked not once, but for the question
不是只进行一次，而是这个问题

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:08.020
to constantly be asked all the time.
要一直不断地被检查。

00:15:08.020 --> 00:15:10.660
I want the cat to be checking, is the distance
我希望这只猫一直检查，鼠标指针的距离

00:15:10.660 --> 00:15:12.640
of the mouse pointer less than 100?
是否小于100？

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:15.370
And any time it turns out that I get to close,
只要发现我靠得太近了，

00:15:15.370 --> 00:15:18.100
then I want for the cat to play the meow sound.
我就希望这只猫发出猫叫的声音。

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:21.050
And that's another case where a forever loop is quite helpful.
这就是“无限循环”非常有用的另一个例子。

00:15:21.050 --> 00:15:23.620
I don't just want to ask this question one time.
我不想只问一次这个问题。

00:15:23.620 --> 00:15:28.100
I want to ask the question forever as long as this program's running.
只要这个程序在运行，我就想一直不断地问这个问题。

00:15:28.100 --> 00:15:31.120
And so I can go into Control, grab a forever block
所以我可以进入“控制”模块，拖出一个“无限循环”积木

00:15:31.120 --> 00:15:34.420
and put it around the condition just like that.
就像这样把它套在条件判断外面。

00:15:34.420 --> 00:15:37.720
And now this question, am I getting too close to the cat,
现在，“我离猫是不是太近了”这个问题

00:15:37.720 --> 00:15:40.120
it's going to be asked not once, but over and over again.
就不是只问一次，而是会反复问。

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:43.550
Every time we ask the question, we'll then ask it again.
每次问完这个问题后，还会再次问。

00:15:43.550 --> 00:15:44.950
I'll click on the flag.
我点击绿旗。

00:15:44.950 --> 00:15:46.070
The program's now started.
程序现在开始运行了。

00:15:46.070 --> 00:15:48.243
We still don't hear anything, but now watch
我们还是什么都没听到，但现在看

00:15:48.243 --> 00:15:50.410
what happens as my cursor gets too close to the cat.
当我的光标离猫太近时会发生什么。

00:15:55.920 --> 00:15:57.810
So it's further away, we hear nothing.
离得远的时候，我们什么都听不到。

00:15:57.810 --> 00:16:03.540
But when I get too close, then you start to hear the cat meow.
但当我靠得太近时，你就会开始听到猫叫。

00:16:03.540 --> 00:16:07.920
And you hear that happen because this condition is now inside of a loop.
你听到猫叫是因为这个条件判断现在在一个循环里面。

00:16:07.920 --> 00:16:10.350
It's repeating over and over again forever,
它会永远一遍又一遍地重复，

00:16:10.350 --> 00:16:15.620
checking to see if the distance is less than 100.
检查距离是否小于100。

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:17.470
And so that then is a forever loop, a loop
这就是“无限循环”，一种循环

00:16:17.470 --> 00:16:20.110
that's going to run some code over and over again, forever,
