And if we're changing the size by 10 every time,
如果我们每次把大小改变10，

00:24:39.700 --> 00:24:43.240
then I'm going to calculate that's 15 repetitions to get it up there.
那么我要算出需要重复15次才能达到那个尺寸。

00:24:43.240 --> 00:24:44.050
And I can try that.
我可以试试看。

00:24:47.750 --> 00:24:52.220
And yeah, it does seem to get to 250, but I had to do a lot of math on my own
没错，它似乎确实能达到250，但我得自己做很多计算

00:24:52.220 --> 00:24:54.860
to figure that out, to figure out, OK, 15, that's
才能弄明白，好的，15次，这就是

00:24:54.860 --> 00:24:57.890
the number of times I would like for this code to repeat.
我希望这段代码重复的次数。

00:24:57.890 --> 00:25:00.620
There is one other type of loop that I'll introduce finally
最后我要介绍另一种循环

00:25:00.620 --> 00:25:03.440
as one final block for today that can sometimes
作为今天最后一个积木，它有时能

00:25:03.440 --> 00:25:05.330
make our logic a little bit easier.
让我们的逻辑稍微简单一些。

00:25:05.330 --> 00:25:08.750
And that's this block here, "repeat until",
就是这个“重复直到”积木，

00:25:08.750 --> 00:25:14.090
and this block effectively tries to combine a loop and a condition.
这个积木实际上是把循环和条件结合在了一起。

00:25:14.090 --> 00:25:16.850
We're going to repeat some blocks, not a fixed number of times,
我们要重复一些积木，不是固定的次数，

00:25:16.850 --> 00:25:22.850
not five times, 10 times, 20 times, but until some question is answered true.
不是5次、10次、20次，而是直到某个问题的答案为真。

00:25:22.850 --> 00:25:26.600
And notice this hexagon-shaped opening is the same as the shape that we saw
注意这个六边形的开口和我们看到的

00:25:26.600 --> 00:25:29.820
in those "if" blocks and the "if-else" blocks, for example.
比如那些“如果”积木和“如果-否则”积木的形状是一样的。

00:25:29.820 --> 00:25:32.750
So what this is going to do is repeat some code
这段代码的作用是重复执行某些代码

00:25:32.750 --> 00:25:36.660
until the answer to some question is true.
直到某个问题的答案为真。

00:25:36.660 --> 00:25:41.480
So if I want the balloon to keep growing until it gets to a size of 250,
所以，如果我想让气球一直变大，直到尺寸达到250，

00:25:41.480 --> 00:25:44.630
then I don't have to do the math and say, OK, that's going to be 15.
那我就不用去算，然后说“好的，那要执行15次”。

00:25:44.630 --> 00:25:49.280
I can just say repeat until, drag the equals sign out,
我只要说“重复直到”，把等号拖出来，

00:25:49.280 --> 00:25:58.950
and I'm going to repeat until the size is equal to 250.
然后我要重复执行，直到尺寸等于250。

00:25:58.950 --> 00:26:02.200
And now I'll take this code that was in the old loop, bring it into the repeat
现在我把旧循环里的代码拿出来，放到“重复直到”

00:26:02.200 --> 00:26:06.660
until block, get rid of my old repeat.
积木里，去掉原来的“重复”积木。

00:26:06.660 --> 00:26:09.170
And this is my new code.
这就是我的新代码。

00:26:09.170 --> 00:26:12.680
I show the balloon, set its size to 100%,
我显示气球，把它的尺寸设为100%，

00:26:12.680 --> 00:26:15.470
we're going to keep repeating until the size is 250.
我们会一直重复，直到尺寸达到250。

00:26:15.470 --> 00:26:18.620
I don't know in advance necessarily how long that's going to take,
我不一定事先知道这要花多长时间，

00:26:18.620 --> 00:26:21.950
but we're going to just keep repeating the code until that's true.
但我们会一直重复执行代码，直到条件为真。

00:26:21.950 --> 00:26:26.300
We're going to change the size, wait 0.2 seconds, and then at the very end
我们要改变尺寸，等待0.2秒，然后最后

00:26:26.300 --> 00:26:30.390
hide our balloon and play that pop sound.
隐藏气球并播放爆炸音效。

00:26:30.390 --> 00:26:37.660
And so I can press the flag, and you see the balloon grow and grow,
我点击绿旗，你会看到气球越变越大，

00:26:37.660 --> 00:26:42.080
and once it reaches 250, at that point the balloon disappears.
一旦它达到250，这时气球就消失了。

00:26:42.080 --> 00:26:45.890
So three different types of loops that we've been able to explore today.
所以今天我们探索了三种不同类型的循环。

00:26:45.890 --> 00:26:49.510
One is the forever loop, that takes some blocks and repeats them over and over,
一种是“无限循环”，它会把一些积木反复执行，

00:26:49.510 --> 00:26:51.940
infinitely, until we stop the program.
无限次，直到我们停止程序。

00:26:51.940 --> 00:26:55.150
One is the repeat block, which repeats a fixed number of times.
一种是“重复”积木，它会重复固定的次数。

00:26:55.150 --> 00:26:57.910
I can say do this five times or 10 times or 20 times.
我可以说执行这个操作五次、十次或者二十次。

00:26:57.910 --> 00:27:01.987
And then, finally, the repeat until block that combines some of the ideas
最后，是“重复直到”积木，它结合了一些

00:27:01.987 --> 00:27:04.570
that we've been taking a look at today, looking at the ability
我们今天看到的概念，也就是具备

00:27:04.570 --> 00:27:08.470
to repeat until a particular question is answered true.
重复执行直到某个特定问题的答案为真的能力。

00:27:08.470 --> 00:27:10.480
And using those loops, we have the ability
通过使用这些循环，我们能够

00:27:10.480 --> 00:27:12.730
to make our programs even more interesting.
让我们的程序变得更有趣。

00:27:12.730 --> 00:27:15.010
Rather than have to click a button multiple times
而不是要多次点击按钮，

00:27:15.010 --> 00:27:17.080
and repeat ourselves with code multiple times,
多次重复编写相同的代码，

00:27:17.080 --> 00:27:21.537
we can let the code repeat itself just via the use of these loops.
我们可以通过使用这些循环让代码自动重复执行。

00:27:21.537 --> 00:27:24.370
That's it for an introduction to Programming with Scratch for today.
今天的Scratch编程入门就讲到这里。

00:27:24.370 --> 00:27:26.995
We have a couple more opportunities to take a look at what else
我们还有几次机会来看看

00:27:26.995 --> 00:27:28.150
we can do with Scratch.
用Scratch还能做些什么。

00:27:28.150 --> 00:27:30.450
So we'll see you next time.
那我们下次再见。
